# A tour of the playground's input: camera, slice, shapes, modes and the toybox.
# Each line is `frame verb args`. A line runs after its frame publishes and lands at the next boundary.
# Raw input: key <code> down|up, pointer <x> <y> down|up [button], pointer <x> <y> move, wheel <lines>, look <dx> <dy>.

# Orbit with a secondary drag, then zoom in and back out.
10 pointer 0 0 down secondary
12 pointer 0.1 0 move
14 pointer 0.2 0.05 move
16 pointer 0.3 0.1 move
18 pointer 0.3 0.1 up secondary
20 wheel 3
24 wheel -1

# Fly: the free camera captures the cursor, so look and the movement keys reach it.
40 camera freecam
44 look 60 -20
46 look 60 -20
50 key KeyW down
70 key KeyW up
72 key KeyD down
82 key KeyD up
84 key KeyE down
90 key KeyE up
100 camera orbit

# Scrub the w slice, pause the spin with its key and pick another shape.
110 slice 0.2
114 slice 0.4
118 slice 0.6
122 slice 0.3
130 key Space down
131 key Space up
140 active 0
150 wireframe on
160 hud on

# Toybox spawns the toys. Grab the center toy and fling it right.
170 demo toybox
200 pointer 0 0.03 down
202 pointer 0.05 0.05 move
204 pointer 0.12 0.08 move
206 pointer 0.2 0.1 move
207 pointer 0.2 0.1 up
260 floor off

# Back to rotate, then reset poses, rotation and slice.
280 demo rotate
300 reset
